#: kmj.py:1063
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This is the classical Mah Jongg for four players. If you are looking for "
#| "the Mah Jongg solitaire please use the application kmahjongg. Right now "
#| "this programm only allows to enter the scores, it will then compute the "
#| "payments and show the ranking of the players."
msgid ""
"This is the classical Mah Jongg for four players. If you are looking for the "
"Mah Jongg solitaire please use the application kmahjongg. Right now this "
"program only allows to enter the scores, it will then compute the payments "
"and show the ranking of the players."
msgstr ""
"Dit is dat klass'sche Mah-Jongg för 4 Spelers. Söchst Du dat Mah-Jongg-"
"Enkelspeel, dat is dat Programm \"kmahjongg\". Opstunns kann Een na dit "
"Programm bloots de Pünkt ingeven, denn reekt dat de Betahlen ut un wiest de "
"Spelerreeg."

